<!--<br/>[[Bicyclobutane|Bicyclo[1.1.0]butane]] is the only C<sub>4</sub>H<sub>6</sub> alkane and has no alkane isomer; [[tetrahedrane]] (below) is the only C<sub>4</sub>H<sub>4</sub> alkane and so has no alkane isomer.]]-->
